big people are round.**.\n   - This is a universal statement that states that all big people are round.\n\n9.**All green, blue people are big.**.\n- This is a universal statement that states that not all green and blue people are big.\n\n10. **If someone is round then they are rough**.\n    - This is a conditional statement that states that if someone is round, they can also be rough.\n\n11. **Not all nice people are blue**.\n    - This is a universal statement that states that not all nice people are blue.\n\nNow, let\'s analyze the information step by step:.\n\n- From point 2, we know that Charlie is not green.\n- From point 6, we know that not all green people are nice.\n- From point 7, we know that not all nice people are cold.\n- From point 8, we know that not all big people are round.\n- From point 9, we know that not all green and blue people are big.\n- From point 10, we know that if someone is round, they can be rough.\n- From point 11, we know that not all nice people are blue.\n\nSince Charlie is green and not all green people are nice, and not all nice people are blue, it follows that Charlie must not be blue\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
