g is unkind, it is not red. Since Bob is not nice (from point 2), he must not be red (from point 10). Therefore, based on the lack of direct information about Bob\'s color being blue, we can conclude that Bob is not smart. The statement "Bob is smart" is false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
