efore, Bob must be blue.\n\nHowever, we also have information about Gary:.\n- Gary is blue.\n- Gary is smart.\n- All blue people are smart.\n- If someone is smart, then they are cold.\n- If Gary is furry, then Gary is cold.\n\nBob is not blue.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
