 not blue (because all red people are green, and Gary is not blue).\n   - Since Gary is red, Gary is not rough (because all red people are not rough).\n   - Since Gary is not blue, Gary is not green (because blue, young people are red, and Gary is not blue).Since Gary is not blue, Gary is white (because if Gary is green, then Gary is blue, and if Gary is white, then Gary is not blue).\nSince Gary is white, Gary is not rough (because if someone is young and not white, then they are rough, and Gary is not young and not white).\n\n3.**Determine the attributes of Anne:**.\n   - Anne is young.\n   - Since Anne is young, Anne is not blue (because all young people are blue).\n   - Since Anne is not blue, Anne is red (because blue, young people are red, and Anne is not blue).\n   - Since Anne is red, Anne is green (because blue, young people are red, and Anne is red).\n   - Since Anne is green, Anne is white (because if someone is blue and white, then they are kind, and Anne is green).\n   - Since Anne is white, Anne is rough (because if someone is blue and white, then they are kind, and Anne is white).\n\n4.**Conclusion:**.\n   - Anne is white.\n   - Since Anne is white, Anne is rough\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
