olor.\n\nFrom point 1, we know that Anne is green.From point 4, we know that Dave is green.Therefore, Dave shares the same color as Anne.Since Anne is green, Dave is also green.Based on the given information, we can definitively conclude whether Dave is white or not.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
